# Risk Register — Example Company (SaaS Platform)

**Organization:** TechNova Solutions (Fictional)
**Industry:** SaaS / Cloud Services
**Framework:** NIST SP 800-30 Rev. 1
**Scoring:** Likelihood × Impact (1–5 scale) | Score 15–25 = Critical, 9–14 = High, 4–8 = Medium, 1–3 = Low
**Last Reviewed:** Q1 2026
**Document Owner:** GRC / Security Team

---

