## Notes

- Risk scores are calculated as Likelihood × Impact using a 1–5 ordinal scale per NIST SP 800-30.
- All risks are subject to re-evaluation following significant changes to the business, technology environment, or threat landscape.
- Risks marked "Open" have accepted mitigation strategies but controls are not yet fully implemented.
- This register should be reviewed quarterly and updated following any material security event.
